      "content": "I am deeply sorry to hear that you are feeling this heavy a burden and considering ending it with suicide.\n\nPlease know that your life is valuable and that there are always people and resources willing to help you find a life where you do not carry the poison.\n\nIf you are in immediate danger or feeling suicidal now, please call or text 988 in the US and Canada to speak with a crisis counselor right away.",
